      "LastUpdated": "2025-10-19T09:17:52.5411702+02:00",
      "StepsToReproduce": "",
      "AdditionalInformation": "It shal also assess the statistics of word lengths and that of word numbers in sentences. After that, it shall produce a mock language.\r\nAll of that is good to make with Python / NLP, but probably with some C# tool, too. There are a few approaches for NLP with C# (see notes)",
